'''Mega Venusaur ex''' (Japanese: '''メガフシギバナex''' ''Mega Fushigibana ex'') is a {{ct|Grass}} Stage 2 {{TCGP|Mega Evolution Pokémon ex}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Crimson Blaze}} expansion.

